@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Say hello
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello

### Loto
# Modes: /loto draws one set; /loto/{count} returns multiple sets as JSON.
# Add ?format=text to /loto/{count} for one set per line.
GET {{baseUrl}}/loto

### Ask the magic 8 ball
GET {{baseUrl}}/8ball

### Make 24 using 3, 3, 8, 8. Each number must be used once.
GET {{baseUrl}}/solve?numbers=3,3,8,8&target=24

### Make 24 using 1, 3, 4, 6
GET {{baseUrl}}/solve?numbers=1,3,4,6&target=24

### Change the numbers and target to your own puzzle
GET {{baseUrl}}/solve?numbers=2,5,7,10,25&target=813

### Impossible target: returns the closest answer
GET {{baseUrl}}/solve?numbers=1,1,1,1&target=100

### Same answer as JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/solve?numbers=3,3,8,8&target=24&format=json
